- **James Reed** highlighted the potential for partnerships with waste management companies to enhance recycling efforts. He suggested exploring collaborations that could facilitate the collection and processing of end-of-life products from consumers.
  - **Example:** Partnering with a local recycling firm to establish drop-off points for used packaging materials, incentivizing consumers to participate in the circular economy through discounts on future purchases.

